{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_14010322:1:1","lang":"cn","texts":{"menu:7005990:1":{"text":"每只火鸡为什么只有两条腿，完全不够吃！","source_cn":"每只火鸡为什么只有两条腿，完全不够吃！","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"},"say:1:1430102101:1":{"text":"我没有！盘子里明明还有……怎么就剩一根鸡腿了？","source_cn":"我没有！盘子里明明还有……怎么就剩一根鸡腿了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0964473D51D9C849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430102102:1":{"text":"我明明只吃了几口而已……完了，这次村长一定会狠狠踢我的屁股！","source_cn":"我明明只吃了几口而已……完了，这次村长一定会狠狠踢我的屁股！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1491DAFD7D56ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430102103:1":{"text":"等等，既然肯定会挨训，那我为什么还要留着这根鸡腿呢？","source_cn":"等等，既然肯定会挨训，那我为什么还要留着这根鸡腿呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E6C4F32177D6B6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:menu:7005990:0":{"text":"火鸡腿被你吃完了？","male":"火鸡腿被你吃完了？","female":"火鸡腿被你吃完了？","source_cn":"火鸡腿被你吃完了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","variant_male_record_index":"270144","variant_female_record_index":"270146"},"say:1:1430102201:1":{"text":"不会的！村长肯定会让人再准备一盘新火鸡腿的！","source_cn":"不会的！村长肯定会让人再准备一盘新火鸡腿的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57081FDBF49D2B1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430102202:1":{"text":"而且那些大人物一定吃过更多好吃的，不会在意区区一盘火鸡腿的！","source_cn":"而且那些大人物一定吃过更多好吃的，不会在意区区一盘火鸡腿的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFE183BFAF1777AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430102203:1":{"text":"不过火鸡腿已经这么好吃了，比它还美味的食物得是什么味道啊……","source_cn":"不过火鸡腿已经这么好吃了，比它还美味的食物得是什么味道啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C93CC88DF100C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:menu:7005990:1":{"text":"耀光特使没得吃了！","male":"耀光特使没得吃了！","female":"耀光特使没得吃了！","source_cn":"耀光特使没得吃了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","variant_male_record_index":"270145","variant_female_record_index":"270147"}},"speakers":{"speaker:格罗姆":{"text":"格罗姆","source":"格罗姆","status":"source"}}}